 colors\\n4. Optional count badge support\\n\\n## Technical Approach\\n\\n1. Analyze differences between EntitiesView.FilterChip and KeyPointsPanel.FilterButton\\n2. Design unified API that supports both use cases\\n3. Create FilterChip component with appropriate props interface\\n4. Update EntitiesView to import and use shared component\\n5. Update KeyPointsPanel to import and use shared component\\n6. Remove inline FilterChip/FilterButton definitions\\n\\n## Files to Modify\\n\\n- `src/components/report/shared/FilterChip.tsx` - NEW: Shared filter chip component\\n- `src/components/report/shared/index.tsx` - Export new component\\n- `src/components/report/views/EntitiesView.tsx` - Use shared FilterChip\\n- `src/components/report/features/KeyPointsPanel.tsx` - Use shared FilterChip (rename from FilterButton)\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n- [ ] Single FilterChip component handles both current use cases\\n- [ ] No duplicate filter chip implementations in the codebase\\n- [ ] Both themes render correctly\\n- [ ] Active/inactive states work identically\\n- [ ] Count badges display properly\\n\\n## Potential Challenges\\n\\n- Subtle differences in padding/sizing (mitigation: add size prop with small/medium options)\\n- Different hover behaviors (mitigation: standardize on single hover pattern)\"\n}'"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2036,"cache_read_input_tokens":130421,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2036},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b50487e-569d-4a38-aca7-0add610c3dda","uuid":"f7105cd1-c32b-4612-9e2d-1173c4d65631"}
